{"id":"00b50f9887ef4bac","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-church-stochastic.md","title":"Church 与 von Mises–Church–Wald 随机频率","display":"df-church-stochastic — Church 与 von Mises–Church–Wald 随机频率","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-church-stochastic","aliases":["43-df-church-stochastic"],"display":"df-church-stochastic — Church 与 von Mises–Church–Wald 随机频率","depends_on":["[[43-df-selection-rule]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§12.1 Definition 12.1.2，印刷327，PDF347","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-church-stochastic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-church-stochastic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-church-stochastic — Church 与 von Mises–Church–Wald 随机频率"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cac6460c6fc0b98\" href=\"?note=5cac6460c6fc0b98\" title=\"43-df-selection-rule\">43-df-selection-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12.1 Definition 12.1.2，印刷327，PDF347"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stochastic}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stochastic}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5cac6460c6fc0b98\" href=\"?note=5cac6460c6fc0b98\" title=\"43-df-selection-rule\">43-df-selection-rule</a>，部分可计算性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；Church分支的全定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，通过显式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表达总性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall r\\;\\left((\\operatorname{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall r\\;\\left((\\operatorname{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{&lt;\\omega})\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall r\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}(r)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall r\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Computable}(r)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Stochastic}(X,r)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按源书术语区分总选择与部分选择，不能将Church和VMCW的机器类合并。</p>\n<p>来源：§12.1 Definition 12.1.2，印刷327，PDF347。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-selection-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-selection-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-selection-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5cac6460c6fc0b98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$r$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$\\operatorname{Stochastic}$ 见 [[43-df-selection-rule]]，部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]；Church分支的全定义域为 $2^{<\\omega}$，通过显式 $\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{<\\omega}$ 表达总性。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$r$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}$，$\\operatorname{Stochastic}$ 见 [[43-df-selection-rule]]，部分可计算性见 [[43-df-computable]]；Church分支的全定义域为 $2^{<\\omega}$，通过显式 $\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{<\\omega}$ 表达总性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stochastic}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X)\\iff\\forall r\\;\\left((\\operatorname{Computable}(r)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(r)=2^{<\\omeg